##
set voltage prohibited
# COMMAND
keithley2410 -S -V 0 50.0 voltage -- -20
# OUTPUT
ValidationError: Value -20.0 does not pass verifier _is_numeric for set() on setting VOLTAGE for device Keithley2410.
Allowable values: Numbers in range [0.0:50.0]
# RETURNS 1
